  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-skill-manager",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness settings plugin for editing, creating, and importing local skills. It reads the active catalog from the host `ctx.skills` registry instead of maintaining a second discovery, priority, or file-watching implementation."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-skill-manager",
      "text": "- Browses the host's active, resolved skill catalog.\n- Writes new skills to `$DSH_HOME/skills/<slug>/SKILL.md`.\n- Groups import candidates by source directory with group selection, select-all, and an empty default selection.\n- Skips duplicate target slugs instead of overwriting them.\n- Keeps edits and imports in the Host and transient interaction state in the Web Client.\n\nSee [README.zh-CN.md](./README.zh-CN.md) for configuration details."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-skill-manager",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness 技能管理插件。在设置中提供独立的“技能”页面，用于编辑、新建和批量导入本地技能。它读取宿主的 `ctx.skills` 活动目录，不再维护第二套发现、优先级或文件监听逻辑。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 浏览宿主解析后的活动技能目录。\n- 直接编辑现有 `SKILL.md`，新增技能写入 `$DSH_HOME/skills/<slug>/SKILL.md`。\n- 导入弹窗按来源目录分组，支持目录级选择、全选，并在每次打开时默认全不选。\n- 导入到 DSH 用户技能目录；同名目标不会覆盖，而是明确跳过。\n- Host 负责通过技能注册表读取和原子写入，Web Client 只维护当前交互状态。"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "```yaml\n- id: dsh-skill-manager\n  name: dsh-skill-manager\n  config:\n    dshHome: D:/dsh-home\n\n`dshHome` 仅覆盖新建和导入目标的 DSH 用户目录。技能来源、优先级、额外目录和文件监听由宿主的 `dsh-skill-filesystem` 配置统一决定。"
    }
  ],
